                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Malik Akbar Hashemi Rafsanjani",
                        "email": "malikrafsan@meta.com",
                        "username": "malikrafsan"
                    },
                    "message": "Hi Ed, sorry for my late response, yup I am more than happy to do so!\n\nI just created a patch here. from my understanding, we would like to have the flag to be flipped and use the `BooleanOptionalAction` action instead, thanks! \ud83d\ude03\n\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/bmcweb/+/82786"
                },
                {
                    "file": "scripts/generate_auth_certificates.py",
